{
  "id": "ppRedraftPost001",
  "name": "PostPilot – Redraft",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PostPilot – Redraft\nThe human rejected a draft and wrote why. The agent rewrites the post using that feedback, checks it again for safety, and sends the new version (v2, v3…) back to the app.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5df4bf50-8a34-1e5c-bc74-18ddf8c495b7",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
